  "profile_version": "0.4.0",
  "status": "provisional",
  "description": "Low-reliability FY27 HHS fallback for PDFs without usable semantic tags. It reconstructs conservative paragraph blocks from visual text lines and reports every calculated metric as an estimate. Passive-sentence percentage uses the provisional deterministic HHS NOFO classifier.",
